# copyrow_diff dictionary (PARSER-INVENTORY lane). Tokens for the COPY
# line/row splitter state machine: EOL styles (LF/CR/CRLF), the \. end-of-copy
# marker (alone and mid-line), CSV quote/escape, and the non-CSV backslash
# escapes that make \\. data not a marker. Input layout is [selector][stream];
# these tokens seed the stream tail.
"\n"
"\r"
"\r\n"
"\\."
"\\.\n"
"\n\\.\n"
"\""
"\"\""
"a\tb\n"
"a,b\n"
"\\\\.\n"
"\\\n"
"x\\.y\n"
